        <title-group>
          <article-title lang="original"><![CDATA[1950년대 전후 희곡에 나타난 실존주의 양상 -오학영과 장용학의 희곡을 중심으로-]]></article-title>
          <article-title lang="foreign"><![CDATA[The Aspect of Existentialism of Dramas in Post Korean War, 1950's -focussing on Oh, Hak-yeong and Chang, Yong-hak's dramas-]]></article-title>
          <article-title lang="english"><![CDATA[The Aspect of Existentialism of Dramas in Post Korean War, 1950's -focussing on Oh, Hak-yeong and Chang, Yong-hak's dramas-]]></article-title>
        </title-group>
        <author-group>
